ro lag.\n\nI also completely rewrote the target scanner and added a custom Raycast Visibility engine.\n\nV7.0 Changelog & Features:\n\nRaycast ESP: Boxes turn GREEN if the enemy is visible, RED if they are behind a wall, and YELLOW when your aimbot locks onto them.\n\nPrediction Aimbot (RMB): Calculates enemy movement velocity (0.045 prediction) so you never miss a running target. Wallbang is fully supported; it locks even if they hide.\n\nOn-Screen FOV Slider: No need to edit the code to change your FOV. You can adjust the circle size dynamically from the watermark panel on your screen.\n\nForced TeamCheck: The scanner completely ignores your teammates. No accidental locks, pure PvP.\n\nOptimized Engine: Trashed the old while wait() loops. This uses an event-based scanner and cached raycast params so your CPU can finally breathe.","tags":["esp","radar","aimbot","fov"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/hZDD6GPt","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69d127133997c8fd82c5381a","username":"helloboiiii22","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69d127133997c8fd82c5381a","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T02:36:22.036Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69dce568b11a4c4eace99205","editBy":{"_id":"69d127133997c8fd82c5381a","username":"helloboiiii22","status":"offline","id":"69d127133997c8fd82c5381a"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-04-13T12:45:28.499Z"}],"comments":[]}